          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontsize='14'>Partial Fulfilled orders: how does retention vary after getting an order which is partially fulfilled?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='8'>* Only showing top 10 chains in Sweden, Taiwan, KSA, Argentina, Kuwait and UAE.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='pede_customer_retention_partial_order_30D_same_vendor' name='federated.0lhtinv0hman0p17tvg5g1rsjk0m' />
