                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Definitions:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Retention 30d (Same vendor):</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> % of users that tried a vendor and came back to the same specific vendor within the next 30 days.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Vendor Trial Base:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> # of users that tried a vendor placing an order with X number of items ordered (quantity ordered)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Failed Order:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'> flag which is True for failed orders</run>
