    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Glossary'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/QC-Performance-CustomerRetentionAnalysis-V1/Glossary?rev=' id='Glossary' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/QC-Performance-CustomerRetentionAnalysis-V1' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='400' maxwidth='1000' minheight='400' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='96000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='2000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Glossary:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='11'>[All metrics are calculated at a QC level]</run>
              <run>

Retention rate M1: Customers that reordered in 1st calendar month after trial / Trial customers in trial month
Retention rate M3: Customers that reordered in 3rd calendar month after trial / Trial customers in trial month
Retention rate 30d: Customers that reordered in next 30 days after trial / Trial customers in a certain date
Days to reorder: Average number of days between trial and 1st successful order. Excludes non-returning customers.

M0 = Trial calendar month
M1 = 1st calendar month after trial
M2 = 2nd calendar month after trial
M3 = 3rd calendar month after trial</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='110' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='109' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='96000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='2000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Glossary:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='11'>[All metrics are calculated at a QC level]</run>
                    <run>

Retention rate M1: Customers that reordered in 1st calendar month after trial / Trial customers in trial month
Retention rate M3: Customers that reordered in 3rd calendar month after trial / Trial customers in trial month
Retention rate 30d: Customers that reordered in next 30 days after trial / Trial customers in a certain date
Days to reorder: Average number of days between trial and 1st successful order. Excludes non-returning customers.

M0 = Trial calendar month
M1 = 1st calendar month after trial
M2 = 2nd calendar month after trial
M3 = 3rd calendar month after trial</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{D5F6B6D8-C701-41D1-A26A-509E7BF28E97}' />
    </dashboard>
